{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"The chosen limit of total debt in relation to income is divided by the housing costs and other debt payments, so that it becomes less of the modeled budget for housing.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"mortgage-affordability-calculator UI copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","detected_language":"sv","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"mortgage-affordability-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer","keys":["mortgage-affordability-calculator.copy.additionalFaqs.2.answer"],"locale":"sv","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Den valda gränsen för total skuldsättning i förhållande till inkomst delas med bostadskostnaderna och andra skuldbetalningar, så att det blir mindre av den modellerade budgeten för boende.","record_id":"64a78afeafe29159ee5af1d17c25cf149a2e113a3d1b1cf9f01389f163d54172","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"41028627586","seconds":1.323214531749997,"source":"The selected total debt-to-income limit is shared by housing costs and other debt payments. More monthly debt leaves less of that modeled budget for housing.","source_commit":"0795f2ac94fd96942ab121fbeaaccf7766f584d4","source_hash":"61a68930aedc3a1dadb4d56517e6851a762b406f8e8c12bc6bf20c853f664190","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Den valda gränsen för total skuldsättning i förhållande till inkomst delas med bostadskostnaderna och andra skuldbetalningar, så att det blir mindre av den modellerade budgeten för boende.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"Uses an average synodic cycle anchored to a reference new moon, not a full astronomical ephemeris. Individual fixed times may differ by hours and the UTC date displayed may differ from a local calendar date. This global phase calculation does not calculate local moon rises, moon sets, visibility or religious calendar dates.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"moon-phase-calculator UI copy.fields.methodNote","detected_language":"sv","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"moon-phase-calculator.copy.fields.methodNote","keys":["moon-phase-calculator.copy.fields.methodNote"],"locale":"sv","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Använder en genomsnittlig synodisk cykel förankrad till en referensnymåne, inte en fullständig astronomisk efemerid. Individuella fastider kan skilja sig med timmar och det visade UTC-datumet kan skilja sig från ett lokalt kalenderdatum.Denna globala fasberäkning beräknar inte lokala månuppgångar, månnedgångar, synlighet eller religiösa kalenderdatum.","record_id":"6467f600da0e567aa018b1cd32a3ef118b7b1c3bb0b7e87c7548f85f4e88d3a3","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":2.630312005124992,"source":"Uses a mean synodic cycle anchored to a reference new moon, not a full astronomical ephemeris. Individual phase times can differ by hours and the displayed UTC date can differ from a local calendar date. This global phase estimate does not calculate local moonrise, moonset, visibility, or religious calendar dates.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"30870c684a9b7cbcd78603b289a08388959d9db0a9b4d591addd5741a14786a4","status":"machine-draft","translation":"Använder en genomsnittlig synodisk cykel förankrad till en referensnymåne, inte en fullständig astronomisk efemerid. Individuella fastider kan skilja sig med timmar och det visade UTC-datumet kan skilja sig från ett lokalt kalenderdatum.Denna globala fasberäkning beräknar inte lokala månuppgångar, månnedgångar, synlighet eller religiösa kalenderdatum.","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
